          "headline": "Cyclone Akvan set to become very severe; Odisha readies evacuation of 2 lakh people",
          "summary": "New since the morning: IMD now expects Akvan to strengthen into a very severe cyclonic storm before crossing the Andhra Pradesh coast on Friday. Odisha has sent 74 rescue teams, including NDRF, and listed more than 200,000 people for possible evacuation. Six southern districts, from Ganjam to Koraput, are mapping landslide-prone villages.",
